CM_ SG_ 2016 force_mask "Which input bits to force";
CM_ SG_ 2016 fault_inject "See BENCH_FAULTS";
CM_ SG_ 2016 aux_mv "Fake 12V reading, 0 = leave alone";
CM_ BO_ 2016 "HOST/BENCH BUILD ONLY. Lets the simulator drive the Pico's wired inputs and inject faults. The real Pico firmware ignores it.";

